    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_such_fire_stealth_2_All_3": "They got the mortar tubes on the roof. You�ve gotta load 'em up and point them at the stage.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_zipline_reminder_1_All_3": "They use cables to rig lights for the show. Keep your eyes open, might have one that can get you across.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_launched_in_combat_1_All_2": "They�re burnin'! Won�t be able to stay up there for long!",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_blackscreen_1_All_1": "This is it! You ready?",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_kill_reminder_1_All_1": "This is what you�re there for! I want him fucking dead!",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_truck_loud_1_All_1": "Those doors aren�t gonna budge! Need to break them open.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_cassette_reminder_1_All_3": "Throw on that tape!",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_fire_stealth_reminder_1_All_3": "Time to start the show. Strike a match and let�s get this going.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_keys_reminder_1_All_4": "Try to get keys for the trucks! Can�t waste any time!",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_debrief_1_All_3": "Turns out this was Hielo's farewell tour. His fans gonna be devastated.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_cassette_1_All_2": "Use the cassette on the sound system! I can�t say it�ll save your lives but it�ll definitely save your ears!",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_pyro_hint_1_All_1": "Use the pyrotechnics on him!",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_escape_1_All_1": "Van�s coming to pick you up.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_zipline_1_All_1": "Venue�s on the other side of the canal, just across the bridge. You can take the line across.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_pyro_early_loud_1_All_5": "Was there a plan there or did you just want to see what that button did?",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_top_1_All_3": "Watch yourselves, don�t let him get a bead on you.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_zipline_reminder_1_All_1": "We got time, but not all night. Use the cable on the roof to zip across if you can�t find a path.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_hielo_down_1_All_2": "We just saved the world from that dickhead's music. We�re fuckin' heroes!",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_fireworks_loud_reminder_1_All_1": "We need to move this along, find the fireworks!",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_no_more_keys_1_All_4": "Well, get to cutting! Keys to the trucks are long gone by now, I�m sure.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_fireworks_stealth_reminder_1_All_2": "We�re gonna steal Hielo's limelight, one final �fuck you�. Get the fireworks.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_buzzsaw_early_loud_1_All_2": "We�re here to kill, not rob! Fine, take it, might be useful.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_boat_1_All_1": "We�re on schedule. This is about the time Hielo�d be on stage for sound check.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_buzzsaw_location_1_All_3": "We�re out of options. Need something to cut open those truck doors. You should take a look at the auto shop.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_fire_stealth_reminder_1_All_2": "We�re set. Burn the fucker.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_wrong_truck_1_All_3": "What are you doing? That�s the wrong truck!",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_truck_key_early_loud_1_All_2": "What are you gonna do with that key?",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_pyro_early_stealth_1_All_5": "What are you thinking?!",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_clipboard_close_1_All_2": "What have they got written down there?",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_wrong_truck_1_All_4": "What the fuck? There�s not gonna be anything in that one!",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_pyro_early_loud_1_All_4": "What�d you do that for?",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_clipboard_close_1_All_1": "What�s on that clipboard?",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_pyro_early_stealth_1_All_2": "Why don�t you just shout out, �Hielo, we�re here to kill you!�",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_pyro_early_loud_1_All_6": "Why?",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_pyro_early_stealth_1_All_4": "Woah, woah, woah, woah! Who told you to press that?",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_pyro_early_stealth_1_All_3": "Wow.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_wrong_truck_1_All_1": "Wrong truck. Wrong truck! Did you read the clipboard or didn�t you?",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_pyro_hit_1_All_4": "Yeah! Do that again!",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_launched_in_combat_1_All_1": "Yes! The rats will have to come out of their nest now!",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_pyro_early_loud_1_All_1": "Yo! What are you doing?",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_hielo_down_1_All_3": "You ask me, he got off easy. But as long as that piece of shit is without a pulse, I�m happy.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_buzzsaw_early_loud_1_All_3": "You can�t help yourself can you? Gotta have a saw on you at all times.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_truck_stealth_reminder_1_All_1": "You find the driver yet? Look, I know it�s a stereotype but keep an eye out for a heavy-set guy.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_buzzsaw_early_loud_1_All_1": "You gonna lug that heavy thing around? I mean, if you think you�ll need it.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_carlos_down_1_All_1": "You got Carlos!",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_launched_all_stealth_1_All_2": "You got Carlos! Hielo�s still standing. He�s next!",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_such_fire_stealth_1_All_2": "You got it!",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_clipboard_found_stealth_1_All_1": "You got it! That�ll save us some time.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_truck_key_1_All_3": "You got it? OK, pop open the trunk.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_buzzsaw_location_1_All_1": "You got nothing on hand that�ll get those truck doors open. You need to find something. Maybe try the auto shop.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_hit_stage_reminder_1_All_3": "You got the fireworks, use 'em!",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_no_fire_loud_1_All_1": "You gotta be kidding me! They�re there somewhere! Open another truck!",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_leave_reminder_1_All_1": "You gotta go!",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_debrief_1_All_5": "You just saved countless people from ever having to listen to that guy's music again. I mean, that deserves a medal or something.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_launched_all_stealth_1_All_3": "You killed his pet! Hielo must be shitting himself up there!",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_wrong_truck_1_All_2": "You knew what the right truck was and still got it wrong!",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_boat_2_All_2": "You know, boats are coming through all the time. I�d wager there�s a couple docked in the canal you could get across.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_boat_reminder_1_All_1": "You need to get across. Try hopping a boat or just take the bridge if you�re ready for a fight.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_clipboard_close_1_All_4": "You see that paper there? What�s it say?",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_escape_1_All_3": "Your van�s coming to get you out of there.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_buzzsaw_location_reminder_1_All_2": "You�re gonna need some proper tools to get those truck doors open. Look inside the auto shop.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_such_fire_loud_3_All_2": "You�re packing the mortars then blasting the stage.",
    "GenericPlanner_ID_hie_wrong_truck_1_All_5": "You�re searching a truck you already know is empty�",
