  "ST_LoadingScreenTips": {
    "loadingtip_custom-blank": " ",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-33": "A drill can work on its own, or you can manually overdrive it to work faster. If you are not careful, the drill can jam.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-29": "AI characters will pick up bags from ground, so you do not have to bother. You can also throw bags to an AI character, so you can spread the load.",
    "loadingtip_mp_hordemode-04": "Acquire the 2� bonus to double enemy drops for a short time. ",
    "loadingtip_meta_police_detectives-03": "Any criminal activity may get detectives attracted if they are operating nearby.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_late-02": "Assassination of an enemy gang lieutenant may result in neutralizing the gang activity on the one turf.",
    "loadingtip_meta_late-00": "Assets are persistent. They stay in your office even after the campaign restarts.",
    "loadingtip_meta_late-03": "Assets make your office prettier and affect the score of each campaign run.",
    "loadingtip_meta_early-01": "Bad choices are fatal. But don�t be too afraid. Learn your lesson, and prevail next time.",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_baker-03": "Baker doesn�t shy away from enjoying the pleasantries of life. Be it purchasing nice cars, lavish furniture or collecting antique curiosities � or at the end of the day, taking a few sips of well-matured whiskey.",
    "loadingtip_meta_early-06": "Baker learns and improves. His boss level is persistent. Even if you fail and restart.",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_casey-03": "Baker, being a greenhorn in Rockay, needed someone who was hooked-up� someone to help get his candy shop up and running. He found Casey.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_donbarbaro-01": "Barbaro arrived to USA from Sicily after the war, spending most of his wild hot years in the northeast. Now he rules the Italian mob in Rockay. Wisely.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_donbarbaro-02": "Barbaro deals with the mayor and supports the RC police department. Italians don�t want any troubles.",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_gloves-05": "Big heists require insider knowledge. Gloves can provide this, for a price.",
    "loadingtip_meta_late-02": "Boss level is a persistent stat. It�s not reset when the campaign restarts.",
    "loadingtip_meta_late-06": "Bribing the police can lower the police heat, but it�s just a temporary solution.",
    "loadtingtip_meta_turfwar_cagnali-04": "Cagnali Industries Autonomous Robotic Sentinel and Security Enforcement Apparatus or C.I.A.R.S.S.E.A. for short� we just call them �robots�.",
    "loadtingtip_meta_turfwar_cagnali-02": "Cagnali Industries has dealings with governments, including ours; both the mayor and the RC police department are in their pocket.",
    "loadtingtip_meta_turfwar_cagnali-03": "Cagnali and her robotic henchmen, aided by the RCPD, are planting their roots in Rockay. ",
    "loadtingtip_meta_turfwar_cagnali-05": "Cagnali must prove to her investors that her machines can work and that she can maintain control. Rockay is her guinea pig�",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_gloves-04": "Calm and meticulous. Gloves will analyze any situation, but he takes his time.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-36": "Cameras can report suspicious activity as well. If you see red color, you should get out of its sight.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_mid-08": "Cameras usually have a central computer system. Find it to disable all of them at once.",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_casey-02": "Casey knows everyone. She is well-connected.",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_casey-04": "Casey loves fancy. Fancy cars. Fancy jewels. Fancy clothes. Fancy boats. Fancy.",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_casey-01": "Casey may look like a secretary, but don�t ever underestimate her ability to command.",
    "loadingtip_quickplay_mid-01": "Characters for the Multiplayer mode can be unlocked through the campaign or Urban Legends, each with steep hiring costs.",
    "loadingtip_meta_mid-02": "Characters you hire at their basic level can be upgraded to a higher tier. Their stats will improve, and they will receive new perks.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_mid-10": "Cheap characters have less health, worse weapons by default and less revives. Rare characters can be very effective and well worth their value.",
    "loadingtip_meta_mid-05": "Check the details of each of the recruits. Choose wisely. Some may be more skilled than the others.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_late-03": "Choose wisely which turfs you attack. You may take two turfs with a single attack, if you separate a rival gang turf from the rest of their territory.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-22": "Civilians will start panicking if you walk around with a gun. Guards will act immediately.",
    "loadingtip_mp_hordemode-10": "Co-operate, adapt, survive� Because only the strongest make it out of Rockay Rumble!",
    "loadingtip_mp_hordemode-01": "Collecting rewards will grant you shop tokens to be used for upgrades. You can spend multiple tokens in a row and at any time you choose.",
    "loadingtip_quickplay_mid-08": "Completing heists, and doing so well, earns respect. With higher respect comes better opportunities.",
    "loadingtip_meta_early-10": "Conquering new turfs brings various rewards worth your while.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-23": "Criminal gangs control Rockay City. The city has become violent and unsafe.",
    "loadingtip_meta_police_detectives-02": "Detectives are deadly opponents of any criminal gang.",
    "loadingtip_meta_police_detectives-01": "Detectives are directed to disrupt any activities of organized crime in the districts of Rockay city.",
    "loadingtip_meta_intro_01": "Do not worry. This game is pretty simple.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_dollardragon-04": "Dollar Dragon has his chest decorated with a massive tattoo of a dragon made out of of dollar bills.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_dollardragon-05": "Dollar Dragon leads the infamous gang of Sicarios or the �Sickos� � Latino thugs and hitmen.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_dollardragon-02": "Dollar Dragon likes cash. But he loves shiny gold even more.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_dollardragon-01": "Dollar Dragon was the right hand of King. After King�s untimely death, he is trying to get the city back in order.",
    "loadingtip_meta_early-15": "Don�t buy expensive weapons too early. Nothing�s worse than being a bankrupt man with a fancy gun. Pistols and knives are good enough.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-04": "Downtown Rockay has one of the largest concentrations of international banks in the United States. It is home to many large domestic and international companies.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-05": "Downtown is the financial heart of the city, which is dominated by the skyscrapers of the city�s Central Business District.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-32": "Drills, saws and C4 can be deployed in some missions to open harder targets by pressing <action id=\"Use\"/>.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-27": "Each bag can hold certain mass of valuables. Every character can hold at least two bags.",
    "loadingtip_meta_early-11": "Each turf brings more money every day.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_late-06": "Eliminate Khan and usurp his entire territory for yourself.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-34": "Enemies will react to trespassing differently. Guards will give you a few warnings. Gangsters will not tolerate you at all.",
    "loadingtip_meta_intro_03": "Enjoy experiments. Feel free to play.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_mid-01": "Even if you lose, attacking the same turf repeatably weakens it. After several attacks, you will have depleted defending forces.",
    "loadingtip_meta_mid-10": "Every criminal action affects police heat. Stealing, killing or other offenses. Sheriff Norris will investigate it.",
    "loadingtip_meta_early-24": "Every run of the campaign is different� varied positions on the map, random events, different story plotlines.",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_gloves-02": "Ex-cop by the name of Gloves � clean hands, cop�s brain, and some really bad habits.",
    "loadingtip_meta_early-04": "Failing is fine. Trying again makes you a better player.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-14": "Fair Fields devolved into a ghetto following the construction of the interstates and various racist laws and policies during the 1950s and 1960s.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-20": "Faster movement is louder. Moving in crouch is the best way how to avoid detection.",
    "loadingtip_mission_def-protectcaptain_01": "Find Touchdown. Do not lose the boss.",
    "loadingtip_quickplay_mid-02": "Finishing Urban Legends gives you a star rating and score. Play them again to achieve a better result.",
    "loadingtip_meta_early-07": "Finishing a campaign run and investing money into assets improves the boss level.",
    "loadingtip_meta_police_swat-05": "For the most stubborn criminals, the RCPD deploys units armed with shock batons.",
    "loadingtip_meta_police_detectives-04": "Get out when you see a detective appearing on the crime scene. They mean Big Trouble, Rockay City.",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_gloves-01": "Gloves knows the cops, the snitches and the streets. He stalks the prey. The detective and the predator.",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_gloves-03": "Gloves thinks that he is too old for this shit.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-01": "Guns are dangerous. Even a few shots can kill you. Maintain cover.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-15": "Hide under cover from your enemies to get a moment to evaluate the situation.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_hielo-01": "Hielo earned his nickname as a child by selling iced water, and the keen business sense has never left him since.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_hielo-03": "Hielo just wants to party. In style. Forever. This requires a lot of money.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_late-07": "Hielo may leave Rockay City, at which point his entire territory becomes up for grabs for his rivals.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-13": "Hip fire is a cool gangster move, but you need more precision to be successful in combat.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_mid-06": "Hold <action id=\"WheelMenu\"/> to bring out the command menu. You can have teammates follow you or stand their ground.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-03": "Icons next to character icon represent max number of revives your character can endure. After that, your character is dead.",
    "loadingtip_quickplay_mid-04": "If a unique character is injured or killed in multiplayer missions, the character won�t be available until healed. Healing is instant but comes at a cost.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_mid-13": "If you act suspiciously too many times, authorities will be called.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_mid-07": "If you break a camera, someone might come and check it eventually.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_mid-02": "If you manage to fulfill all of the objectives, you are awarded with an extra reward after each mission.",
    "loadingtip_mp_hordemode-08": "In Rockay Rumble you step into the arena with nothing but your selected perks. Upgrade to the most powerful weapons, buy the best equipment, and unlock special abilites to survive!",
    "loadingtip_mp_hordemode-09": "In Rockay Rumble you will kill enemies � collect rewards � earn shop tokens � and upgrade your gear.",
    "loadingtip_meta_intro_turfwar-01": "In turfwar, you play as one of many. Don�t worry about casualties. Death just passes you to another soldier.",
    "loadingtip_quickplay_early-09": "Injuries and deaths persist as you progress through a single Urban Legend.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_donbarbaro-03": "Italian mobsters keep their turfs and mind their business.",
    "loadingtip_meta_intro_02": "It�s all right not to understand everything. Take it easy.",
    "loadingtip_quickplay_early-01": "Jobs in the Multiplayer mode are separate missions played for money. Shuffle is a randomized mission chain with a cash bonus on top, and Urban Legends are mission chains played with a preselected team for a tough challenge and character unlocks.",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_casey-05": "Just when you think you�ve got Casey figured out, she turns a corner you didn�t know was there. She keeps everyone on their toes!",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_khan-02": "Karl Kong calls himself Khan as believes that he is direct descendant of Genghis Khan, the famous Mongolian warlord and emperor.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_khan-01": "Khan is a vicious Mongolian crime warlord and wanna-be emperor of Rockay City.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_khan-03": "Khan is obsessed with hunting old antiquities and relics, with the belief they grant him supernatural powers.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_khan-04": "Khan leads the gang called the �Riders� � crazy bikers ready for any kind of violence or crime.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_khan-05": "Khan�s Riders carry out widespread violent crimes, including drug dealing, trafficking in stolen goods, gun-running, extortion, and prostitution operations.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-24": "Killing people may be a quick solution. But police investigation will later hurt you much more. Sheriff Norris wants to shut you down.",
    "loadingtip_meta_police_sheriff-07": "LT is a local boy-scout who shot to the top of the pig-farm � after the brass got wiped out.",
    "loadingtip_meta_police_sheriff-06": "LT is the right hand of Sheriff Norris.",
    "loadingtip_mission_def-jackedcandy_01": "Losing candy here will be a setback for Travis Baker, but his story will continue.",
    "loadingtip_meta_early-09": "Make sure you always have enough money. Steal more or get a loan.",
    "loadingtip_mp_hordemode-02": "Make sure you have enough revives! If you go down in Rockay Rumble, your revives will be used to get you up immediately and will eliminate enemies around you.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-16": "Melee attacks are quite lethal in stealth.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-26": "Most heists have an expected loot goal. This is Nasara�s plan on how much loot he is ready to convert to cash.",
    "loadingtip_quickplay_early-10": "Multiplayer jobs and the Shuffle are the primary ways to earn money, while Urban Legends provide a challenge and character unlocks.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-06": "Nasara always has a plan on how to convert the planned loot into cash. Poor execution of a heist will cost you.",
    "loadingtip_meta_mid-03": "Nasara converts the loot to cash. Everything you steal over the plan, stays in your stash, waiting to be sold for the best price.",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_nasara-01": "Nasara is the man behind the man. A big-time operation isn�t possible without a strong right-hand.",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_nasara-03": "Nasara knows many in the Rockay City underground, but very little is known about the man himself.",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_nasara-02": "Nasara takes care of the team.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-27": "On Rockay�s western borders are the �Everglades�, a tropical marshland inhabited by alligators and flamingos.",
    "loadingtip_meta_early-12": "Opportunities are about performing heists and robberies to get more money.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_hielo-02": "People may be fooled by his cordial facade, but Hielo is a man who has earned the loyalty of his crew and trampled all those who thought him weak.",
    "loadingtip_mp_hordemode-06": "Picking a weapon upgrade gives you new weapon and also a damage buff. It affects all future weapons, not just the one you pick.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_mid-03": "Pinging with <action id=\"Ping\"/> can help you keep track of your enemies.",
    "loadingtip_meta_mid-01": "Planning your financial moves in advance is often necessary. Or you can get a loan.",
    "loadingtip_quickplay_early-07": "Play Urban Legends to unlock more stories.",
    "loadingtip_quickplay_mid-05": "Play Urban Legends with a single character from start to finish; this will unlock that character for recruitment in the Team tab.",
    "loadingtip_quickplay_early-03": "Playing and failing Urban Legends doesn�t have any persistent negative consequences.",
    "loadingtip_quickplay_early-14": "Playing missions on higher difficulties yields greater rewards.",
    "loadingtip_meta_mid-12": "Police heat affects the police response time and type of the responding police units.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-31": "Press <action id=\"Ability1\"/> to use equipment. If it is a grenade or another throwable item, it will be tossed in the direction you are looking.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-18": "Press <action id=\"Ability1\"/> to use equipment. It can be anything from a rock to a grenade.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-12": "Press <action id=\"Aim\"/> to aim down the sights. Precision is the difference between a hit and a miss.",
    "loadingtip_quickplay_mid-06": "Promoting unique characters to the maximum level in the campaign makes them available for hire in Multiplayer mode.",
    "loadingtip_meta_late-01": "Purchasing assets will significantly boost the boss level.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_late-05": "Put pressure on a rival gang, and they may pay you money to stop your conquest.",
    "loadingtip_quickplay_early-13": "Recommended jobs guide you toward missions more suited to your experience, but you can play any job you wish from the selection.",
    "loadingtip_meta_early-05": "Relish in your failures. Don�t make the same mistake twice.",
    "loadingtip_mission_candy-01": "Retrieve your lost blue candy. Don�t let the boss die.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-21": "Rockay City experienced sharp economic growth from tourism in the early 80s. Today, not even twenty years after its first skyscraper, it�s become a glowing star on the world map.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-30": "Rockay City is a major center and leader in finance, commerce, culture, arts, and international exchange.",
    "loadingtip_common_heisters-01": "Rockay City is a paradise for any wanna-be criminals. Nasara knows how to find and train the best talents.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-01": "Rockay City is a sun-drenched metropolis in Southern Florida.",
    "loadingtip_meta_police_cops-01": "Rockay City is on fire. The level of crime and violence is striking. The Sheriff needs to call more cops.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-29": "Rockay City is the second largest tourism hub for international visitors, right after New York City.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-22": "Rockay City offers easy entertainment and forbidden leisure. Money feeds the decadence and the moral decline of the city.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-25": "Rockay City politicians are mere puppets of the criminal bosses. They do nothing but the bidding of the gray eminence behind them.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-02": "Rockay City started as a small fishing village, until the construction boom during the twentieth century transformed the sleepy town into a booming modern city.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-19": "Rockay City thrives at night, and the vast array of lavish entertainment opportunities attract businessmen and celebrities alike.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-17": "Rockay City�s Art Deco District was the first 20th century neighborhood to be recognized as historic.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-10": "Rockay Port, the city�s seaport, is the busiest cruise port in the world in both passenger traffic and cruise lines.",
    "loadingtip_mp_hordemode-03": "Rockay Rumble rewards increase as you survive through the boss waves.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-11": "Rockay port is often called the �Cargo Gateway of the Americas�.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_donbarbaro-05": "Rumor is that Barbaro had disputes with the Italian godfather in New York and was forced to move to Rockay City.",
    "loadingtip_meta_police_swat-02": "SWAT is much better equipped to fight the daring criminals and armed gangs.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_donbarbaro-04": "Scudomnion or the �Scudos� is the name of Italian mafia of Rockay City.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_early-02": "Sending fewer soldiers into turfwar is cheaper but more risky.",
    "loadingtip_meta_police_sheriff-01": "Sheriff Norris arrived into Rockay after its mayor and most influential people died in an explosion. This caused the city to fall into disarray and lead to a tug of war amongst the local gangs.",
    "loadingtip_meta_police_sheriff-05": "Sheriff Norris battles bad guys, low-lifes, and evil criminal masterminds to bring peace and order to Rockay City.",
    "loadingtip_meta_police_sheriff-04": "Sheriff Norris is a former Marine and a modern-day Ranger who believes in the Code of the Old West.",
    "loadingtip_meta_late-04": "Sheriff Norris is investigating all criminal activity in the city. Once he has enough evidence, he will hit on Baker hard.",
    "loadingtip_meta_late-05": "Sheriff Norris will gather all evidence needed against Baker sooner or later. Then the cops will raid Baker�s hideout and put an end to his criminal empire.",
    "loadingtip_quickplay_early-11": "Shuffle offers way to play a chain of randomized missions in Multiplayer without risking your team, and a potential bonus on top of the regular reward if the entire chain is completed successfully.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-19": "Some actions � such as running, crouching, sliding or jumping � will raise suspicion of guards. Eventually they may trigger an alarm.",
    "loadingtip_meta_intro_bes-01": "Something bad has happened to Nasara.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-08": "Sometimes things can go wrong. If they do, you may want to forget about the planned loot, get into the escape van and save the lives of your team.",
    "loadingtip_meta_early-16": "Steal as much as you can to boost your cash flow. You receive loot above the target value as a bonus.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_late-01": "Successful heist rewards you with money. It is up to you to invest it as you please.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-13": "Swamp Road was the first part of land to be reclaimed from the Everglades over a century ago.",
    "loadingtip_meta_police_swat-03": "Tactical units of SWAT are often equipped with shields. The kink in the armor is the little fortified window.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_mid-01": "Take your time and explore surroundings of your mission area� unless you are in combat. Then you might want to focus on other things.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-04": "Team members can die. They will remain dead for the rest of the playthrough.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-16": "The Beach district is roughly divided into: the touristy Flamingo, the luxurious suburban Nautilus Keys of posh places and condos, and the low-key but still slightly touristy Big Surf.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_hielo-04": "The Chicos are Hielo�s crew of dealers and rappers. Some could even make it far, if only they would not get in your way.",
    "loadingtip_meta_mid-04": "The Lucky perk will prevent you from receiving negative perks when you are upgrading the heister.",
    "loadingtip_meta_police_cops-02": "The RCPD would normally deal with typical criminal cases. But with the assassination of the so called underworld King, the situation elevated into a regular crime war.",
    "loadtingtip_meta_turfwar_cagnali-01": "The Scudos work against organized crime and police alike, and only for the highest bidder. You�d be hard-pressed to find anyone who can outbid Cagnali Industries.",
    "loadingtip_meta_police_sheriff-02": "The Sheriff won�t stand for crime, and promised to squash everyone who crosses the law. His commitment is to return the city to a righteous path.",
    "loadingtip_meta_early-20": "The art of heisting is to avoid police. Fighting SWAT is the most desperate action. It will not end.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_hielo-05": "The best place to party is Ibiza. Hielo would love to get there with his entire crew.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-07": "The canals are the vibrant veins of the city. A high-rise waterfront mixed with smaller, occasionally Latin-flavored streets, there are wonderful views of the islands of the gulf, the sea, and by the river.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-06": "The center of Rockay City has an impressive waterfront with walkable sections. The city�s memorable skyline of towers offers wonderful views of the islands, the gulf, and the sea.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-18": "The city has numerous marinas, rivers, bays, canals, and the Atlantic Ocean, which make boating, canoeing, sailing, and fishing the most popular outdoor activities.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-26": "The endangered Key deer has been spotted on the outskirts of the city again, in increasing numbers. This is a good year.",
    "loadingtip_mp_hordemode-07": "The explosion at the end of each wave will generate only the lowest reward. Make sure to eliminate the strongest enemies yourself.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-28": "The favorable climate is the main attraction of Rockay City. Azure skies, warm sunlight with high humidity, and an overall subtropical climate dominate.",
    "loadingtip_meta_early-18": "The flow of the game depends on your decisions and the results of missions you play.",
    "loadingtip_meta_early-02": "The game will change every time you play it. It restarts but it remembers.",
    "loadingtip_meta_early-17": "The goal of the campaign is to conquer the entire city.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-24": "The late King was the leader of the Rockay underground, and kept a tight grip on all criminal activities and illegal incomes in the city. Several contenders now seek to take over his vacant throne.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_mid-11": "The more influence over the city you have, the better weapons and characters will become available.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_early-04": "The more soldiers you send, the more retries you have.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_mid-12": "The more time you spend in a fight, the more dangerous enemies will appear.",
    "loadingtip_meta_early-22": "The more turfs you own, the higher respect you have.",
    "loadingtip_meta_early-03": "The more you fail, the more you learn.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-09": "The neighborhood�s name �Beautiful Ridge� comes from the slightly elevated, lush terrain by the river.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-08": "The net of rivers and canals strongly defines the character of the city.",
    "loadingtip_meta_police_swat-04": "The newly-deployed heavy SWAT units come equipped with nigh-impenetrable armor, heavy fire power and intensive short-range flash attack. Their only weakness are their oxygen tanks.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-12": "The port is one of the nation�s busiest cargo ports, importing as much as 4,241,603 tons of cargo in 1990.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-03": "The prohibition era helped in laying a solid foundation of Rockay City�s criminal underground when the dire need for booze and entertainment attracted many good samaritans willing to help out.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-05": "The purpose of heists is to get money. Healthy cash flow is important, as taking over the city is a costly endeavor.",
    "loadingtip_meta_mid-09": "The rivalry between opposing gangs go aside when doing trades� but only to certain point.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-20": "The smooth, sandy beaches of Rockay City have turned it into a very popular tourist destination.",
    "loadingtip_meta_early-19": "The threat of violence is more efficient than shooting.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_late-04": "There are faster ways to conquer enemy territories, if fortune presents you the opportunity.",
    "loadingtip_mission_def-jackedcandy_02": "There is always another way to succeed.",
    "loadingtip_meta_police_sheriff-03": "They say the Sheriff never sits down� also never blinks, and doesn�t need to eat since he�s sustained by pure justice. These may be just rumors, but you shouldn�t push your luck.",
    "loadingtip_meta_intro_04": "This game is about failing and trying again.",
