    "loadingtip_mission-00": "This is mission tip.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar-00": "This is turf tip.",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_touchdown-02": "Touchdown is a Vietnam war veteran and diehard fan of sports. Especially football.",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_touchdown-01": "Touchdown is a tough-as-nails war veteran and a former halfback in the NFL, who rose to nationwide fame.",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_touchdown-04": "Touchdown is the coach of Baker�s army of thugs.",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_touchdown-03": "Touchdown likes to think on his feet. While running, with a machine gun.",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_touchdown-05": "Touchdown will personally see to the defense of any turf. And he will protect it until he goes down. Or until the police comes.",
    "loadingtip_meta_mid-06": "Trade deals give you possibility to sell loot from your stash for a much better price.",
    "loadingtip_meta_mid-07": "Trade deals may be dangerous. Don�t negotiate too hard. Don�t piss off your enemies.",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_baker-08": "Travis Baker is a typical American badass.",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_baker-04": "Travis Baker is the Crime Boss. But he wants to become the King.",
    "loadingtip_meta_ftue-01": "Travis Baker is the boss. Don�t let the boss die.",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_baker-06": "Travis Baker likes mariachi pants.",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_baker-02": "Travis Baker never goes out without his cowboy hat.",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_baker-07": "Travis Baker prefers revolver weapons, as they are more dignified.",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_baker-05": "Travis Baker wants to make Rockay City his own.",
    "loadingtip_meta_entourage_baker-01": "Travis Baker was a small-time drug dealer who arrived into the Rockay City to expand his business. The death of the King was an unexpected opportunity.",
    "loadingtip_quickplay_early-12": "Try Quickjoin to quickly pair up with other players in a random mission.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_mid-02": "Turf you have successfully defended will be weakened. It will be harder to resist an opposing force the next time around.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_early-01": "Turfwar costs money. You pay for sending an army to take a neutral territory, attack rivals, or defend your own turfs.",
    "loadingtip_mission_wza-ftue_01": "Turfwar is chaos. You play as one of many and needn�t worry about casualties. Death just transfers you to another soldier, until you have none left.",
    "loadingtip_meta_mid-13": "Turfwar is the most expensive activity. It will drain a lot of cash and increase the police heat.",
    "loadingtip_quickplay_early-05": "Unlock all the characters and achieve the highest respect level.",
    "loadingtip_quickplay_mid-03": "Up your gameplay and try to beat your best score in Urban Legends and Rockay Rumble.",
    "loadingtip_quickplay_early-02": "Urban Legends consist of three playable missions chained together in the form of a mini-campaign.",
    "loadingtip_quickplay_early-08": "Urban Legends need to be completed with the specified set of characters.",
    "loadingtip_meta_early-13": "Use money to recruit new characters to the team.",
    "loadingtip_meta_early-14": "Use money to recruit new soldiers for your army.",
    "loadingtip_meta_early-21": "Use stealth. Try to avoid armed conflicts if possible. Shootouts are dangerous.",
    "loadingtip_common_rockay-15": "Visually and functionally, the area is defined by the monstrous interstate intersection that displaced many of its residents and broke it apart.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_late-01": "Weakening an enemy gang will result in lower numbers of their thug armies.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_dollardragon-03": "When King was the Boss of Rockay City, there was peace. Dollar Dragon is trying to emulate the King to make the city whole again.",
    "loadingtip_meta_police_swat-01": "When SWAT appears on the crime scene, it means serious troubles for any law offenders.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-02": "When not being hurt for a certain amount of time, your health will slowly regenerate.",
    "loadingtip_meta_mid-11": "When the police heat is high, the cops will arrive to a crime scene faster and with better force.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-09": "When you can see the enemy, the enemy can see you too. Crouch behind obstacles to get out of sight.",
    "loadingtip_meta_early-08": "Whenever Baker gains a new boss level, he can choose an upgrade for his entourage.",
    "loadingtip_quickplay_early-04": "While Urban Legends has no long-term risk; running jobs and using the Shuffle endangers your characters.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-28": "While carrying more than one bag, characters are not able to draw their primary weapon or manipulate more complex objects.",
    "loadingtip_mp_hordemode-05": "While you cannot bring your boss�s loadout to Rockay Rumble, your perks still apply � choose wisely!",
    "loadingtip_meta_early-23": "With higher respect, Baker has access to more profitable heists, better weapons and more skilled teammates.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_mid-15": "With more criminal activity, police get more active. Detectives will appear more around the city, and heavier units will appear sooner in mission.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_mid-14": "With more territory and successful heists, your infamy will grow. It will attract better characters and allow you to buy better weapons.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-14": "You can change fire modes on some weapons using <action id=\"SwitchFireMode\"/>. Some people like to spray and pray, some like to aim.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-07": "You can escape by interacting with the van at any time. But you will only get what is in the van at that moment.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_mid-05": "You can hold <action id=\"WheelMenu\"/> to issue a quick order � �Hold your position� or �Follow me�.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-21": "You can holster your weapon if alarm was not yet raised.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_mid-09": "You can invest your money in an army, teammates, weapons and assets. Your expenses will allow you to pursue your preferred style.",
    "loadingtip_quickplay_early-06": "You can join any heist in co-op, even if you haven�t unlocked yet.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-17": "You can press <action id=\"Bash\"/> to bash someone at close range. It deals greatly increased damage when unseen, but it�s not very effective in the heat of combat.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-25": "You can scream down civilians so they stay on ground, but you need to keep them in check or they will flee. You can zip-tie them to help.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-23": "You can see police badges in the upper right corner. This shows the current intensity of police force.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-30": "You can shoot, or bash with <action id=\"Bash\"/> to open crates and break other destructible objects.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-35": "You can slide if you press <action id=\"Crouch\"/> while running.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_mid-04": "You can switch between characters in the single player mode. Hold <action id=\"WheelMenu\"/> and select one.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-11": "You can vault when you are near a suitable obstacle. Just press the <action id=\"Jump\"/>.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_early-03": "You need soldiers to conquer a neutral territory, but it�s cheaper than attacking turf under the control of a rival gang.",
    "loadingtip_gameplay_early-10": "You will lean automatically if you are aiming near a corner.",
    "loadingtip_meta_mid-08": "Your choice of the crew to attend the trade deal can affect the result. Some characters can haggle better or are just intimidating.",
    "loadingtip_meta_turfwar_early-05": "Your soldiers can use guns of fallen enemies to improve their chances in turfwar.",
