  "ST_Meta": {
    "meta_gang_hielo_boss_description": "A party boy with a�knack for business. \r\nHe may seem to take nothing seriously and certainly enjoys the�pleasures of life, but don't be fooled � his jovial demeanor hides a�shrewd mind of a�capable leader.",
    "meta_gang_baker_boss_description": "A small time drug kingpin who arrived in the city in order to expand his business, now given a chance of his wildest dreams to usurp the entire city for himself. \r\nFortune favors the bold, but then again, so does the morgue.",
    "meta_tutorial-text_heister-info": "After sending people to a mission, they need to rest until the next day, making them unavailable. End the day to refresh them.",
    "meta_partner_agent_title": "Agent",
    "meta_gang_khan_boss_description": "An alleged descendant of the Great Genghis Khan, Khan wants to rule everything in sight with his mighty biker gang Riders. \r\nTough and rough, with no mercy for those who cross his path on his conquest of Rockay City.",
    "meta_tutorial-text_army_title": "Army",
    "meta_tutorial_hirearmy_capacity": "Army capacity shows the maximum number of soldiers that you are able to hire, and increases with the boss�s respect. However, you may get soldiers above your current army capacity from capturing turfs and random events.",
    "meta_gang_dollardragon_boss_description": "As the former right-hand man of the late King, Dollar�Dragon seeks to avenge his boss�s death and restore the former order. \r\nHe�s an old-school, reasonable man � but he�s got no patience to tolerate anyone�s nonsense.",
    "meta_gang_baker_boss_title": "Baker",
    "meta_gang_cagnali_boss_title": "Cagnali",
    "meta_gang_cagnali_boss_description": "Cagnali inherited her father's small toolshop in her early years, transforming it from a village family business into an�international conglomerate. Her intelligence is not to be underestimated.",
    "meta_partner_captain_title": "Captain",
    "meta_partner_secretary_name": "Casey",
    "meta_tutorial_team-required": "Certain missions require a specific person to be started. Everyone�s gotta get their hands dirty.",
    "meta_gang_hielo_gang_title": "Chicos",
    "meta_gang_hielo_gang_description": "Chicos description",
    "meta_gang_dollardragon_boss_title": "Dollar Dragon",
    "meta_tutorial-text_end-day_title": "End the day",
    "meta_tutorial_end_day_hint": "End the day",
    "meta_tutorial-text_end-day": "Even the best boss needs to sleep sometimes. Tomorrow, your underlings will be refreshed and the story will progress.",
    "meta_tutorial_office_stash-trend": "Even the markets of the criminal world live by supply and demand. The price of loot gradually changes, and sometimes it pays off to hold onto your loot just a little bit longer.",
    "meta_tutorial_boss-entourage": "Everyone has certain special skills, and your entourage is full of uniquely talented people. Take note of their abilities and who will be most effective in helping you secure the crown.",
    "meta_tutorial-text_finance_title": "Financial info",
    "meta_partner_agent_name": "Gloves",
    "meta_gang_baker_gang_title": "Graves",
    "meta_gang_baker_gang_description": "Graves description",
    "meta_tutorial_lobbyprivacy_description": "Here you can adjust your lobby's privacy settings. Public lobbies will be visible to everyone in the session browser unlike private lobbies � but your friends can be invited to either.",
    "meta_tutorial_team-loadout": "Here you can outfit your team with new weapons and equipment. Unlocking the gun trade allows the purchase of more advanced weaponry for your arsenal.",
    "meta_gang_hielo_boss_title": "Hielo",
    "meta_tutorial_team-refresh-combined": "If you don�t like the daily selection of recruits or weapons, you can roll the dice and get a new batch; however, the price to refresh will increase until it�s reset the next day.",
    "meta_tutorial_team-refresh-characters": "If you don�t like the selection of recruits for hire, you can roll the dice and meet a new batch; however, the price to refresh will increase until it�s reset the next day.",
    "meta_tutorial_office_stash-loans": "If you�re running low on cash, see your local loan shark. Be warned though, their exorbitant interest rates will cost you dearly.",
    "meta_gang_khan_boss_title": "Khan",
    "meta_gang_king_boss_title": "King",
    "meta_gang_king_boss_description": "King is the leader of the city�s underground, and de facto ruler of the entire Rockay. \r\nNo crime happens without his consent and a hefty cut, and the police don�t dare to even sneeze without his approval. Even the mayor is on board, because even though crime is rampant, the city enjoys an unprecedented era of stability.",
    "meta_tutorial-text_finance-info": "List of income, expenses and the total balance for the current day. Positive balance means you did well today.",
    "meta_tutorial_team-status-missing": "Missing: When jobs go south, teammates can turn up missing. They may find their own way back, require a daring rescue� or never be heard from again.",
    "meta_tutorial_team-specialobjectives": "Missions may have a special objective whose completion affects your final reward.",
    "meta_partner_righthand_name": "Nasara",
    "meta_tutorial-text_hire_heister": "Nasara can recruit new team members.",
    "meta_gang_none_title": "Neutral territory",
    "meta_tutorial_goals-take": "Pick a goal to take the next step in your criminal career. Completing goals advances the story, leads to new missions and vast rewards.",
    "meta_tutorial_lobbyprivacy_title": "Privacy settings",
    "meta_tutorial_team-cleanexecution": "Professionals don�t leave tracks. Civilian casualties and dead team members leave a trail of evidence which can land you in prison. Be careful.",
    "meta_tutorial_hirearmy_available": "Ready soldiers are those you can still use today. All soldiers in your army refresh each day.",
    "meta_tutorial_team-status-away": "Resting: Team members sent on missions need time to rest. They will be available again the following day.",
