    "meta_tutorial_team-multiplecharacters": "There�s safety in numbers. For most missions, you can assign multiple characters.",
    "meta_tutorial-text_crew": "This is your team led by boss Baker. They are skilled and valuable � so they only partake in heists and moneymaking missions and stay away from the brunt of the turf war conflict.",
    "meta_tutorial_hirearmy_total": "Total soldiers represent the amount of recruits you currently have in your army, including resting.",
