    "meta_assets_story_cup_goldtrophy_description": "The spoils from your visit to the gold depot � few dare dream of such lavish fortune, but now it�s all yours. It's enough to last several lifetimes, or just one, lived to the fullest.",
    "meta_assets_story_cup_jet_description": "There is traveling in style. And then there is traveling with a pile of gold so large, you barely make your weight clearance.",
    "meta_assets_story_dds_dragondogs_description": "These sensational sculptures are near mythological examples of Eastern occultism. Mere possession of these magnificent masterpieces is said to set the owner on a path to preeminence.",
    "meta_assets_story_piano_description": "This DuzzelDorfer is one of only four of its kind in the continental United States. The distinctive sound is music from heaven. The satisfaction of owning such a revered treasure� well, that is for you to decide.",
    "meta_assets_ketchup-plain_description": "This bottle of condiment was the first thing you found in the storage when you purchased the club, and now can�t bring yourself to throw away. It brings you good luck. And keeps your fries tasty.",
    "meta_assets_shop_camera_description": "To get where you want to go it helps to know where you�ve been. This vintage camera illustrates a firm foundation of what came before.",
