    "meta_bosslevel_category_captain_description": "Keeping Touchdown on the field makes you a powerhouse. Your captain on the battlefield � taking turf and beating back attacks. \r\n\r\nYou grew-up with this tough-as-nails son of a bitch, NFL hall-of-famer, and war vet. Champion, Coach, and completely fucking crazy. ",
