    "Max": "Max",
    "meta_bosslevel_category_army": "Nasara",
    "NextLevel": "Next level bonus",
    "meta_bosslevel_category_campaignstart_description": "Playing Casey�s game is a high-value proposition. Super connected and whip-smart, she's got a firm grip on your cash-flow � and knows how to hustle. \r\n\r\nA real-deal woman. Casey knows everyone in town worth knowing. Mysterious about her past, but she�ll get you in where it counts.",
    "meta_bosslevel_bonus_investigation": "Slower police investigation gain",
    "meta_bosslevel_bonus_money-start": "Starting money bonus",
    "meta_bosslevel_category_progression_description": "The man with the master-plan, knows Rockay like the back of his hand. Put Gloves on � and your hands stay clean. \r\n\r\nA former detective who�s still got connections on the force to stop the heat from burning your ass. But this ex-dick has some dirty little habits.",
    "meta_bosslevel_category_captain": "Touchdown",
    "Value": "Value",
    "meta_bosslevel_category_army_description": "Your right-hand man levels up your team to be bigger, faster, and stronger.\r\n\r\nOrganized and sly. Nasara brings you unique talent. He handles your distribution, loot, and a hell of a lot more. Brought in by Casey, this former naval officer washed up on the Rocky City beach � with a knife in his back. A sole survivor of his shipwreck. ",
    "meta_bosslevel_category_boss_description": "You�re a badass charmer from the wrong side of the tracks. Keep on rocking your way through Rockay � and you�ll get some boss-worthy bonuses coming your way.\r\n\r\nNot afraid to mix it up with whoever wants to rumble, you came to Rockay City to sling party pills into the rave scene. Then BOOM! � the reigning Crime Boss gets blown to bits. Now�s your chance to switch your nickname from Candyman to The King.",
