    "meta_char_veteran_description": " ",
    "meta_char_lector_description": "A brilliant engineer and an honorable protector of his family, which for this awesome aural architect, causes a dynamic descent onto the boomy byways of Rockay City. An honest man with a difficult plan, Shivaji Kumar is ever a man of his word, and the word of the day is CRIME.",
    "meta_char_wiz_description": "A certified genius when it comes to computers, technology� and everything else if you ask him, more than likely even if you don�t. Humberto Wamba or �Wiz� as he calls himself, is The Man, or so he claims. His lifelong streak of bad luck is solely due to his associations. If he could only find competent underlings, ahem collaborators, Wiz (and they) could run the world� straight off a cliff. But technology and computers are the future, and he swears you can trust him on this!",
    "meta_char_tuna_description": "A man of few words, but at his size he doesn�t need them. The man called Tuna can be found beside the doormen of the hottest spots in town. As good as he is at protecting doors, he is far better at breaking them down. The very definition of muscle for hire, Tuna is a force of nature when he takes the job, as there are few willing or stupid enough to try and stop him.",
    "meta_char_hielo_description": "A party boy with a knack for business. Earned his nickname as a child by selling iced water at the height of summer to thirsty folks, and gave in to the allure of the big city which offered vastly more opportunities to succeed. \r\n\r\nA jack of all trades who takes nothing seriously and enjoys the pleasures of life, but his jovial demeanor hides a shrewd mind of a capable leader.",
    "meta_char_tulip_description": "A single blossom found upon the body. They know he did it. They are certain it was him, but nothing on the scene tangibly connects the man with the flower of the same name left behind. This debonair French Florist known only as Tulip is widely thought to be an Assassin bar none. But the only ones who can confirm it� lie cold with a flower on their corpse.",
    "meta_char_baker_description-kingalive": "A small-time drug dealer who arrived into the Rockay City to expand his business. Travis Baker longs for the opportunity to meet with the King of the criminal underworld to receive his blessing to start selling his special brand of blue candy large-scale. And such opportunity may soon come to be.",
    "meta_char_adventurer_title": "Adventurer",
    "meta_char_agent_title": "Agent",
    "meta_char_mrx_description": "Alexandros Richards called �X� by all, has come to Rockay seeking answers. This expert operator is none too particular about who he has to go through to get them. Rockay was once home for him and his, but no longer. He has traveled the roughest parts of the world learning all the skills he needs to find out why.",
    "meta_char_dollardragon_description": "An old-school, reasonable man who held significant influence in the city for way longer than anyone else alive � and he's got no patience left to tolerate anyone�s nonsense.",
    "meta_char_assassin_title": "Assassin",
    "meta_char_bodybuilder_title": "Bodybuilder",
    "meta_char_boss_title": "Boss",
    "meta_char_bouncer_title": "Bouncer",
    "meta_char_gangster_title": "Brute",
    "meta_char_robot_title": "Buddy",
    "meta_char_chasemax_title": "CHASE (max)",
    "meta_char_casey_title": "Casey",
    "meta_char_chase_title": "Chase",
    "meta_char_clutch_title": "Clutch",
    "meta_char_crackermax_title": "Commando Cracker",
    "meta_char_cracker_title": "Cracker",
    "meta_char_cracker_description": "Dishonorably discharged and imprisoned for acting on bad intel, Nigel Thorne, a once respected SAS member, has found a base of operations in the action-filled streets of Rockay City. Cracker utilizes the readily available criminal elements to stay sharp, and build his network, preparing for the day that he gets the location of those who betrayed him�",
    "meta_char_dollardragon_title": "Dollar Dragon",
    "meta_char_driver_title": "Driver",
    "meta_char_escort_title": "Escort",
    "meta_char_forehand_title": "Forehand",
    "meta_char_touchdown_description": "From ground zero to the gridiron, this halfback should have been in the Hall of Fame. A forced early retirement sent Troy Dalton from the stadium to the streets.",
    "meta_char_gloves_title": "Gloves",
    "meta_char_hielo_DLC_title": "Golden Boy Hielo",
    "meta_char_peak_description": "Gustav Bruckner was born on the wrong side of the bedsheets, literally. This sour sharpshooter acts as if the world is out to get him, because it is. If being in the wrong place at the wrong time was a skill, Peak would get top marks. But Peak is tired of being destiny�s whipping boy and in Rockay, he aims to bring all his troubles to their climax.",
    "meta_char_ropes_description": "Hailing directly from Eire and born for the boxing ring, Romy O�Neil aka �Ropes� received a one-way ticket to Rockay City when he applied a little too much street justice to the wrong man. But it ain�t all sour grapes as the city provides better weather, better opportunities, and better scenery� Now all Ropes needs is better luck!",
    "meta_char_wizmax-2_title": "Head Honcho",
    "meta_char_hielo_title": "Hielo",
    "meta_char_clutch_description": "However a devil he is behind the wheel, life won�t let Enrique Dirangen keep his hellfire on the asphalt. Beset on all sides by avatars of the underworld, try as he might, this wily wheelster seems destined to use his endless drive� in pursuit of crime.",
    "meta_char_thug_mut-m_description": "Jack of all trades. He can do a bit of everything but otherwise has no special talent of his own.",
    "meta_char_thug_mut-f_description": "Jack of all trades. She can do a bit of everything but otherwise has no special talent of her own.",
    "meta_char_employee-janitor_title": "Janitor",
    "meta_char_mozart_description": "Johan Sommer is a true composer of orchestrated chaos. This sinister virtuoso of violence is equal parts hedonist and psycho-killer, bound only to his hidden agenda and even more secretive masters. Why he is in Rockay and for what will certainly be a symphony of destruction.",
    "meta_char_jupiter_title": "Jupiter",
    "meta_char_jupitermax_description": "Jupiter has earned her moniker! She has completed her father�s work and has synthesized a new and highly effective performance enhancer. She can now carry up to three bags and fistfight a bear if the need arises.",
    "meta_char_volk_description": "Ladislav wants nothing more than to be an action hero! He�s come to Rockay to live the thrills and solidify the skills needed to be a box office big shot. But the hero's journey is not for everyone, and he�ll find plenty of fun and funds in the roughshod role as the rapscallion.",
    "meta_char_lector_title": "Lector",
    "meta_char_runaway_description": "Marie Chambernet has an arsenal of assets, and this savvy seductress knows how to work them all. To solve her need for speed, she capitalizes on the greed that so many have for the finer things in life. But all too often greed goes too far, so our lady had to go from the city of lights to Rockay nights.",
    "meta_char_hitman_title": "Merc",
    "meta_char_theresamax_title": "Mighty Mother",
    "meta_char_theresa_description": "Mother knows best! Theresa Flowers has devoted her life to the lost. The streets of Rockay are no place for kids to play. Pontification and paperwork provide neither food nor shelter, and with time running out, Mother has the will to do whatever it takes to make a space for those the system has left behind.",
    "meta_char_mozart_title": "Mozart",
    "meta_char_mrx_title": "Mr. X",
    "meta_char_nasara_title": "Nasara",
    "meta_char_crackermax_description": "Nigel Thorne, a�former SAS operative, is the ultimate shadow in Rockay�s criminal underworld. Lethal at any range, he blends stealth, savage close combat, and pinpoint accuracy. His �SAS Instinct� enables him to sense enemy positions, making him a�ghostly predator who turns any battleground into his personal playground of�controlled chaos.",
    "meta_char_smoke_description": "Ninja by night, Sean-Shiro Matsuda has come to Rockay for one thing�WAR. But the Ninja always strike from the shadows. Mild mannered cabbie by day, this certified shinobi spends his nights earning coin and collecting coups, methodically dismantling the clan that dares to dishonor their sacred traditions.",
    "meta_char_peak_title": "Peak",
    "meta_char_ranger_title": "Ranger",
    "meta_char_jupitermax_title": "Roidiac Jupiter",
    "meta_char_ropes_title": "Ropes",
    "meta_char_runaway_title": "Runaway",
    "meta_char_scientist_title": "Scientist",
    "meta_char_silver_title": "Silver",
    "meta_char_smoke_title": "Smoke",
    "meta_char_vamp_description": "Sonia Sanchez is a haughty hematopathologist. In her quest to be the best, she turns to those prone to frequently needing medical attention, and little recourse for questionable reactions. This second-generation medical marvel is determined to conquer death itself! And with the wild ways of Rockay, bodies with which to play are easy to come by.",
    "meta_char_specialist_title": "Specialist",
    "meta_char_stinger_title": "Stinger",
    "meta_char_unknown_title": "Teammate",
    "meta_char_technician_title": "Tech",
    "meta_char_baker_description": "The boss himself.",
    "meta_char_boss_description": "The boss himself.",
    "meta_char_chase_description": "The man to call if you want something moved� including bodies. Charles Henry Esson the third was cursed by the Witch he was hired to kill. Now this Shotta finds himself in play on the crazy streets of Rockay. Out of his element and under siege by his own senses, he works the scene to gain the means to find the witch, take her down, and break the curse once and for all. ",
    "meta_char_theresa_title": "Theresa",
    "meta_char_thief_title": "Thief",
    "meta_char_ranger_description": "This tough as nails Vietnam vet knows only the cold comfort of spitting hot lead, or that of the government sanctioned drugs that keep him, what they like to call, functioning. Still, a warrior born in the action-filled streets will not long be able to resist the call. As they say violence isn�t the answer, violence is the question and the answer is YES!",
    "meta_char_thug_title": "Thug",
    "meta_char_silver_description": "Tomorrow is not a promise, and nobody knows this better than Kadee Garimara. This former socialite learned the hard way that fortune can turn on a dime, and is determined to make the most of the only true commodity one has. Time.",
    "meta_char_touchdown_title": "Touchdown",
    "meta_char_baker_title": "Travis Baker",
    "meta_char_tulip_title": "Tulip",
    "meta_char_tuna_title": "Tuna",
    "meta_char_unique_title": "Unique",
    "meta_char_volkmax_title": "VOLK (max)",
    "meta_char_vamp_title": "Vamp",
    "meta_char_veteran_title": "Veteran",
    "meta_char_vampmax_title": "Vixen Vamp",
    "meta_char_volk_title": "Volk",
    "meta_char_wizmax-1_title": "WIZ 1 (max)",
    "meta_char_hitman_mut-f_description": "Weapon specialist through and through. You can count on her in any fight.",
    "meta_char_hitman_mut-m_description": "Weapon specialist through and through. You can count on him in any fight.",
    "meta_char_stinger_description": "What he lacks in stature he more than makes up for in personality, and loyalty, often to a fault. Franco Mesce-Bertrand is a perfect gentleman to the ladies, and an unshakeable ally to his employer. But some allies go too far and Stinger�s exile to Rockay from The Big City is a direct result of his aggressive defense activities.",
    "meta_char_employee-janitor_description": "When Mr. Roberts started with his lucrative janitor gig in late King's high-security gold depository, he knew he made himself a target for all wannabee treasure hunters who seek a way in.\r\nThen finally, Travis Baker gave him an offer he couldn't refuse � a ton of money.",
    "meta_char_forehand_description": "Whether it�s playing out the point, or calculating an acid dissociation constant, Lothar Uhlig is the very definition of competence, but the line ends sharply there. Life outside of work for Forehand is a shambling mess of bad luck and worse choices, but maybe he�s bound to turn that around as he hopes to play and work his way, in Rockay.",
    "meta_char_jupiter_description": "With the name of a god amongst gods and the physique to match, Jupiter owes her incredible size to steroids, but that�s not all she gained. With an attitude that makes a mule seem reasonable, and a mouth that would make a sailor blush, her monstrous reputation is well earned. But few can match her power and tenacity when on the job.",
    "meta_char_wiz_title": "Wiz",
    "meta_char_wizmax-2_description": "Wiz knows he�s the best in the biz�ask him, he�ll tell you! He better dress to look the part. Inspired by his favorite rapper, Hielo�just don�t tell Baker�Wiz, too, is going for gold.",
    "meta_char_gangster_mut-f_description": "Your go-to bruiser. Durable in combat, but not too shabby in the stealth department either.",
    "meta_char_gangster_mut-m_description": "Your go-to bruiser. Durable in combat, but not too shabby in the stealth department either.",
    "meta_char_thief_mut-f_description": "Your go-to bruiser. Durable in combat, but not too shabby in the stealth department either.",
    "meta_char_thief_mut-m_description": "Your go-to bruiser. Durable in combat, but not too shabby in the stealth department either.",
    "meta_char_robot_description": "You�re a robot, but everything else is the same.",
    "meta_char_chasemax_description": "[[ Chase (max) description ]]",
    "meta_char_theresamax_description": "[[ Mighty Mother description ]]",
    "meta_char_vampmax_description": "[[ Vixen Vamp description ]]",
    "meta_char_volkmax_description": "[[ Volk (max) description ]]",
